questions.questionText:
In a certain code language,

&lsquo;A + B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo;

&lsquo;A - B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo;

&lsquo;A × B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the sister of B&rsquo;

&lsquo;A &divide; B&rsquo; means &lsquo;A is the wife of B&rsquo;

Based on the above, how is L related to P if &lsquo;L &divide; M + N - O × P&rsquo;?
